                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9457a062-5b37-33f1-8f7e-fe66895fa8ba",
                                        "entry_id": "f146056e-9620-3ad5-8d95-ff5c021491f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Selbstschutz des Körpers gegen Infektion"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4144dad-cfe9-49d1-81ce-a0d76ea5459d",
                                                "sense_id": "9457a062-5b37-33f1-8f7e-fe66895fa8ba",
                                                "text": "Hatte man als Kind die Masern, folgt in der Regel nach der Erholung eine lebenslang anhaltende Immunität."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b261db1f-ceb2-3762-8e3f-69bf41f9a43c",
                                        "entry_id": "f146056e-9620-3ad5-8d95-ff5c021491f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Schutz (eines politischen Amtsträgers) vor Strafverfolgung"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ab51311-d39b-4b4a-adf3-ffa5bf192bd2",
                                                "sense_id": "b261db1f-ceb2-3762-8e3f-69bf41f9a43c",
                                                "text": "„Schwere Schlappe für Silvio Berlusconi: Ein Gesetz, das ihm Immunität gewährte, wurde vom italienischen Verfassungsgericht gekippt“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce4e5205-327b-4da5-af53-39c1ddfbf3c8",
                                                "sense_id": "b261db1f-ceb2-3762-8e3f-69bf41f9a43c",
                                                "text": "„Daher wurde er festgenommen, ohne Rücksicht auf seine Immunität.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71ca4749-b563-4e5b-a32a-519f506c2782",
                                                "sense_id": "b261db1f-ceb2-3762-8e3f-69bf41f9a43c",
                                                "text": "„Die Immunität, die ich suchte, lag jenseits der Allerdurchlauchtigsten Republik.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "255786c1-f728-4d5d-bf25-29814b79b692",
                        "source_entry_id": "334f6adb-ffbb-39bf-9935-6163398b4986",
                        "source_sense_id": "2132745b-66d6-3a4b-b9bd-c41c65ad4cc8",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvatbaarheid voor een ziekte",
                        "target_lang_word": "immunity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "immunity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a22d198b-e6a9-323e-8f32-fe451292f6f3",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "Protective resistance against disease."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f3cfa13-fb60-4c9c-bdb9-2f9252130a3d",
                                                "sense_id": "a22d198b-e6a9-323e-8f32-fe451292f6f3",
                                                "text": "Some people have better immunity to diseases than others."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3eb4608d-1fde-3c88-aad3-6de0c15c160b",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "An exemption from specified duties, such as payments or services."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a192a3b-c965-4bf0-ad9a-4350b6fdaec3",
                                                "sense_id": "3eb4608d-1fde-3c88-aad3-6de0c15c160b",
                                                "text": "Feudal privileges often included tax and other immunities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6aef08ec-251b-3001-81f1-57512947c06f",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "An exemption from prosecution."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c299fe8-c6ee-46f2-9e46-027890e38892",
                                                "sense_id": "6aef08ec-251b-3001-81f1-57512947c06f",
                                                "text": "The prosecutor offered the lieutenant immunity for all the crimes he would testify having known to be planned by the elusive drug baron."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d32cfa04-bbe6-382e-a6ff-2b34d09540c5",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "An exemption from penance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38abbfb2-189a-432f-a5fb-f23411eb9920",
                                                "sense_id": "d32cfa04-bbe6-382e-a6ff-2b34d09540c5",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, his reason rebelled, and his sense of religion by no means allowed the justice of refusing the amiable, handsome, and wealthy Englishman, whom his sweet child preferred, and who was perfectly willing that the signora should enjoy all the liberty required by her conscience and her church, together with such sums as should, from time to time, purchase the prayers of the faithful, and all other immunities, so far as his fortune furnished the means."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e997c628-7f2f-3f10-afc2-be8a3f3c2bdb",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being insusceptible to something; notably:",
                                            "An exemption given to a player from losing or being withdrawn from play."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c4bee0-9664-4413-a82a-41f8f2dca6ea",
                                                "sense_id": "e997c628-7f2f-3f10-afc2-be8a3f3c2bdb",
                                                "text": "After winning the last round the player was granted immunity which allowed him to stay in the game even after receiving the fewest points."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f5dc799-22e0-36da-a3a8-ef146c1bb9d0",
                                        "entry_id": "0aec09c5-145c-3b03-b339-5fe28743f6df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A resistance to a specific thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78069303-b1de-45f3-9d36-f3c5d5beee83",
                                                "sense_id": "4f5dc799-22e0-36da-a3a8-ef146c1bb9d0",
                                                "text": "Superbugs are bacteria that develop an immunity to antibiotics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f13c9eb4-246e-451c-81e3-94d2d61377b9",
                        "source_entry_id": "334f6adb-ffbb-39bf-9935-6163398b4986",
                        "source_sense_id": "2132745b-66d6-3a4b-b9bd-c41c65ad4cc8",
                        "source_sense_description": "onvatbaarheid voor een ziekte",
                        "target_lang_word": "immunité",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "immunité",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9440d52e-0cc9-3350-b4fc-28182a8c7934",
                                        "entry_id": "ba0675c4-8194-35b0-aacf-74af2adb04ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exemption d’impôts, de devoirs, de charges, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a4887fd-20e3-4a0d-b150-55df64bfaf2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9440d52e-0cc9-3350-b4fc-28182a8c7934",
                                                "text": "J’en appellerai à Rome contre toi, répondit le grand maître, pour usurpation sur les immunités et privilèges de notre ordre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "872938ec-0d03-3cd3-93e9-2993b6c91289",
                                        "entry_id": "ba0675c4-8194-35b0-aacf-74af2adb04ec",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Propriété que possèdent certains êtres vivants de ne pouvoir contracter à nouveau ou de contracter sans gravité une maladie qu’ils ont déjà eue ou contre laquelle ils ont été vaccinés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0569cba-dcca-411f-a125-835cdc163ff3",
                                                "sense_id": "872938ec-0d03-3cd3-93e9-2993b6c91289",
                                                "text": "Donc, la cessation d'une épidémie ne tient pas à ce que le principe morbifique existant a perdu de sa malignité, mais à l’immunité acquise par la population où elle vient de sévir, combinée avec l’extinction rapide du principe même."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfca531f-a593-44da-8260-f496e9370e70",
                                                "sense_id": "872938ec-0d03-3cd3-93e9-2993b6c91289",
                                                "text": "Cette première phase d’accalmie a été de plus de trois ans. […]. Cela tient sans doute à ce que la population immigrée pendant la première époque provenait de diverses parties de la France qui avaient subi elles-mêmes l’épidémie de 1871, et se trouvait de jouir ainsi de l’immunité post-épidémique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb195538-2cd7-4db8-8b74-078a062004a2",
                                                "sense_id": "872938ec-0d03-3cd3-93e9-2993b6c91289",
                                                "text": "Depuis que le Premier Ministre britannique Boris Johnson en a parlé pour justifier la politique initiale de laisser-faire de son pays face au Covid-19, la notion d’« immunité collective » est au cœur du débat. S’agit-il de sacrifier les plus faibles pour préserver le plus grand nombre dans une optique néodarwinienne ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef2aae56-ff40-43a2-ac62-e364e5a102d7",
                                                "sense_id": "872938ec-0d03-3cd3-93e9-2993b6c91289",
                                                "text": "Pour le vaccin, on se posait la question ; on repoussait. On misait sur l’immunité naturelle, on pensait qu’on la renforçait », explique l’Albigeoise en rendant hommage à son ami."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
